rect\" title=\"Spell Point\">Spell Point</a> cost of your spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Exceptional Universal Spell Power +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Exceptional Universal Spell Power +8</a>:</b> Passive: +8 Exceptional bonus to Universal Spell Power.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Draconic_Prophecy\" title=\"Named item sets\">Draconic Prophecy</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Draconic_Prophecy\" title=\"Named item sets\">Draconic Prophecy</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+5 Artifact bonus to Universal Spellpower<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Magical Resistance Rating Cap</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Trinket Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Trinket Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Dragon%27s_Eye.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Dragon%27s_Eye.png/420px-Dragon%27s_Eye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Dragon%27s_Eye.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Dragon%27s_Eye\" title=\"Item:Epic Dragon&#39;s Eye\">Epic Dragon's Eye</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A massive star ruby that resembles an eye, especially as it winks from time to time.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><b>Bug: </b> Exceptional Universal Spell Power gives Exceptional <a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency</a> instead.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 202